sequenceDiagram
    title User Interaction Flow (Balanced)
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant API as Backend (FastAPI)
    participant SVC as Services (MLP/Transformer/NLP/XAI)

    User->>FE: Fill form and submit
    FE->>API: POST /predict
    API->>SVC: Run MLP inference
    SVC-->>API: Top 3 careers + scores
    API-->>FE: Results

    User->>FE: Request explanation
    FE->>API: GET /xai
    API->>SVC: Compute SHAP
    SVC-->>API: Explanation + plot
    API-->>FE: Explanation

    User->>FE: Upload resume (optional)
    FE->>API: POST /resume/analyze
    API->>SVC: Extract + Embed + Compare
    SVC-->>API: Skill gap report
    API-->>FE: Analysis
flowchart LR
